 {"name":"physical priors (round 2)","value":"mask on (log n, log N(HCO+)) plane applied to the s353 likelihood cubes (scripts/s356_q57_physical.py): log n >= 3.8 or 4.2 (grid lower edge 3.0 dropped), and path length L=N(HCO+)/(x n) <= 100 pc (N core) or 450 pc (beam) with [HCO+]/[H2] <= 1e-8 (or 3e-9); alternative prior flat in log n 3-6. Evidences re-normalised to the allowed prior volume."},
 {"name":"error-model sensitivity","value":"systematic 5% / model 10% (default) halved (2.5%/5%) and doubled (10%/20%); cubes out/q57/cube_*_s*_m*.npy"},
